<title>USA: Chaus Jun 30 Q4 shr loss $0.41 vs loss $0.42.</title>
<headline>Chaus Jun 30 Q4 shr loss $0.41 vs loss $0.42.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Sept 18 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		 $(0.41)     loss     $(0.42)</p>
<p> Net loss		(10,660)     loss     (8,614)</p>
<p> Sales		     32,694		   28,688</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	26,265		   20,324</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		 $(1.02)     loss     $(1.40)</p>
<p> Net loss		(24,386)     loss    (27,913)</p>
<p> Sales		    170,575		  181,697</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,987		   19,910</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Fiscal fourth quarter 1995 net income loss includes $0.5 million for unusual expenses. The company said losses during the fourth quarter 1996 reflected higher levels of off price sales due in part to difficult market conditions.</p>
</text>
